  "description": "This stunning 2 bedroom 1 bathroom villa enjoys street frontage amongst a delightful group of only eight units close to shopping, public transport and the freeway for easy access into the CBD.<br/><br/>The highlight here is a fantastic front courtyard and alfresco entertaining deck, all off an open living and dining area boasting high ceilings and low-maintenance flooring within. <br/>The kitchen is efficient and comprises of quality contemporary appliances, whilst the practical and fully-tiled bathroom is brilliant in its simplicity.<br/><br/>The main bedroom has split-system air-conditioning and the spare features built-in wardrobes. Aside from a large front carport with tandem room for two vehicles, there is also a second single carport at the rear of the property - enough space to comfortably park three cars in total.<br/><br/>Only minutes separates this splendid home from the picturesque Swan River, Neil McDougall Park, Waterford Plaza shops, Curtin University and other top educational facilities, including Aquinas College, Manning Primary School and St Pius X Catholic School. <br/><br/>Other features include, but are not limited to:<br/><br/>- Open living and dining area with air-conditioning and external side access<br/>- A Westinghouse gas oven, a gas cook top and a Bosch dishwasher in the kitchen<br/>- Laundry with toilet<br/>- Linen press<br/>- Lock-up storeroom off rear carport<br/>- Gas hot water system<br/><br/>Please register your details by clicking the button to \"book an inspection\" or \"register for an inspection\". You will then receive an email with a link to apply.",
